# This repo tracks the emulator/build scaffold and our decisions (CLAUDE.md,
# AGENTS.md, Dockerfiles, scripts, the android-dev skill). It must NOT track any
# large or machine-specific container state — that all lives elsewhere:
#   - the SDK/AVD/system images live on /data/storage/android (outside this dir)
#   - each app's Gradle cache lives in <project>/.gradle-cache (outside this dir)
# The patterns below are belt-and-suspenders in case any of that ever lands here.

# Per-project Gradle caches / build output, if ever created in-tree
.gradle-cache/
.gradle/
build/
**/build/outputs/

# Android SDK / AVD / system images, if ever bootstrapped in-tree
sdk/
avd/
*.qcow2
*.img
*.zip

# Built artifacts
*.apk
*.aab

# BAM Store payload + generated catalog (store/ subtree). The APK binaries live
# on the big disk (directories.bam-store-apks); icons and index.json are
# regenerable with store/tools/reindex. The changelog sidecars under
# store/repo/apks/*.json ARE committed — they're the only thing that can't be
# rebuilt from the binaries. (*.apk is already ignored globally above.)
store/repo/icons/*
store/repo/index.json
store/client/local.properties
store/client/.kotlin/

# Signing keys + anything fdroidserver writes with a password in it. The repo
# signing keystore lives on the big disk (directories.fdroid-keystore), but if
# one ever lands here it must never be committed.
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pass
keystore*
config.py
keypass*

# Machine-specific config + private notes (source of truth stays on-box only)
config.yaml
NOTES.local.md

# Editor / OS noise
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
